The native renderer C/OpenCL implementation and its synthetic contract tests
are distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later, consistent with the project's shared
engine. Build wiring and documentation are MIT. Explicit per-file notices
take precedence; tests/ffmpeg_metadata_fields.c retains its MIT notice.

License texts are in LICENSES/. The dovi_tool notice is retained alongside
the extension-metadata grammar attribution. FFmpeg headers, OpenCL headers,
drivers and compiler binaries are separate dependencies, not relicensed by
this notice. See SOURCES.md and the complete product's upstream notices.

No Dolby certification, patent license or independent legal clearance is
implied by this source distribution.
